THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
--------------------
Manufacturer datasheets are not redistributed. Values are stored with a source
URL, a content hash and a retrieval date; source.redistributable governs whether
a document body may be stored at all.

Standards text (IEC, ISO, SAE, UN) is never reproduced. Clause identifiers and
citations are stored as references.

Vocabularies (BDF, EMMO/BattINFO, OPTIMADE, BPX) remain under their own
licences, recorded per row in vocabulary.license. Materials data is federated by
identifier to Materials Project, OQMD, AFLOW and NOMAD rather than re-hosted.

